<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - SOCGEN DOWNGRADES SHELL.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SOCGEN DOWNGRADES SHELL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts at SocGen downgraded Shell to &quot;sell&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; on Thursday after disappointing second quarter earnings, market sources said.</p>
<p>Further details were unavailable but SocGen was also said to be cutting full-year earnings estimates.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
